		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:vrrdgcidwpvn4omvn7uuufoo/app.bsky.feed.post/3li5oe2g66s2b",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:hewhabm3uw73cbz27uwuydcg/app.bsky.feed.post/3li5o3ftflc2w",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jakelazaroff.com/post/3li5oe2g66s2b",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jake Lazaroff",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jakelazaroff.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:vrrdgcidwpvn4omvn7uuufoo/bafkreihwaff3ctjdb5uq2p7r4yenu3uvkbuzgazvlzavumvzgy2gdtjhje"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-14T16:58:05.136Z",
			"content": "<p>yeah i think i feel more strongly about the principle of least surprise than about whether to define by default or not</p>\n<p>like, i personally prefer define by default, but if there were a community expectation of opt-in definition via a query string param i’d choose that pattern over my own preference</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jgwanpgdadflp2skdss2a7hk/app.bsky.feed.post/3li5ou545as2l",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/joeldrake.bsky.social/post/3li5ou545as2l",
			"author": {
				"name": "Joel Drake",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/joeldrake.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jgwanpgdadflp2skdss2a7hk/bafkreico4twtk3eezpgut2w2oz3d6ugvndn55rtle7lbhy4up7jhq3mdde"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-14T17:07:04.821Z",
			"content": "<p>I read it as Node Fine. 🙃</p>\n<p>How about camel casing it?</p>\n<p>?noDefine</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3li5t77hwyc22",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jgwanpgdadflp2skdss2a7hk/app.bsky.feed.post/3li5ou545as2l",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3li5t77hwyc22",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-14T18:24:51.374Z",
			"content": "<p>I personally don’t like relying on case sensitivity in query param keys (acknowledging that they are case sensitive) 😅</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/app.bsky.feed.post/3li63rg7ca22s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3li5nuv56hc2q",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/robmeyer.net/post/3li63rg7ca22s",
			"author": {
				"name": "Rob Meyer",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/robmeyer.net",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/bafkreih3chn4ludv3lf2hodduusqt7psewtxvssoggn5glkbjdtzlp46su"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-14T20:58:12.340Z",
			"content": "<p>I *feel* like it should be opt-in to avoid unwanted surprises, but assuming the query string arguments work well with all major bundlers, it's easy enough to opt-out that defaulting to define isn't a major hang-up for me.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/app.bsky.feed.post/3li63rgckps2s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/app.bsky.feed.post/3li63rg7ca22s",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/robmeyer.net/post/3li63rgckps2s",
			"author": {
				"name": "Rob Meyer",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/robmeyer.net",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/bafkreih3chn4ludv3lf2hodduusqt7psewtxvssoggn5glkbjdtzlp46su"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-14T20:58:12.341Z",
			"content": "<p>I've been craving standardization one layer up (when should the script be fetched) -- I see several useful settings: (1) deferring script loading until the (not yet defined) custom element nears the viewport, (2) defer until used in DOM, (3) defer until idle, (4)...</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/app.bsky.feed.post/3li63rgcmoc2s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/app.bsky.feed.post/3li63rgckps2s",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/robmeyer.net/post/3li63rgcmoc2s",
			"author": {
				"name": "Rob Meyer",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/robmeyer.net",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:x6gox2spfccened4qbaj4b5b/bafkreih3chn4ludv3lf2hodduusqt7psewtxvssoggn5glkbjdtzlp46su"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-14T20:58:12.342Z",
			"content": "<p>(4) \"immediate\" in the sense that the script tag would be added, but timing may be influenced by any of the &lt;script&gt; policies -- async, defer, blocking=render, fetchpriority, etc.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
