				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:prsjlcqmyr3unqje5g6gzbxw/bafkreicmgiut2fprnqwxl77xndpf3jcrftazwaurgpy7lqotoz7b46qjne"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-15T10:49:49.188Z",
			"content": "<p>&gt; opt-out of define<br>\n&gt; want different tag name<br>\n&gt; run script before definition</p>\n<p>Why create a behemoth of a Web Component <br>\nthat caters for IFs that will never happen?</p>\n<p>it is OOP</p>\n<p>𝙘𝙪𝙨𝙩𝙤𝙢𝙀𝙡𝙚𝙢𝙚𝙣𝙩𝙨.𝙙𝙚𝙛𝙞𝙣𝙚(\"𝙢𝙮-𝙘𝙤𝙢𝙥𝙤𝙣𝙚𝙣𝙩\", <br>\n 𝙘𝙡𝙖𝙨𝙨 𝙚𝙭𝙩𝙚𝙣𝙙𝙨 𝙘𝙪𝙨𝙩𝙤𝙢𝙀𝙡𝙚𝙢𝙚𝙣𝙩𝙨.𝙜𝙚𝙩(\"𝙮𝙤𝙪𝙧-𝙘𝙤𝙢𝙥𝙤𝙣𝙚𝙣𝙩\"){ ... })</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dev.to/dannyengelman/more-wordle-mordle-extending-josh-his-web-components-4li\">dev.to/dannyengelma...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
