		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3liiarhs6e22e",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liiaddfek223",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com/post/3liiarhs6e22e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Konnor Rogers",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/bafkreihcn5u3o5m6hmxjcmhzv2v3s6rltvslkcmxs2zlxi4rp6s77kybtm"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-18T21:54:20.103Z",
			"content": "<p>Looks like im in good company...</p>\n<p>// Auto registers as &lt;light-editor&gt;<br>\nimport \"light-pen/exports/components/light-editor/light-editor-register.js\"</p>\n<p>// Manual Register<br>\nimport LightEditor \"light-pen/exports/components/light-editor/light-editor.js\"<br>\nLightEditor.define()<br>\n// =&gt; Registers as &lt;light-editor&gt;</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liibc7jbhc2v",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3liiarhs6e22e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3liibc7jbhc2v",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-18T22:03:41.850Z",
			"content": "<p>oh interesting, I don’t mind this pattern in your *-register.js</p>\n<p>```<br>\nimport LightEditor from \"./light-editor.js\";<br>\nexport default LightEditor;<br>\nLightEditor.define();<br>\n```</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liibcm5g322v",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liibc7jbhc2v",
