				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/fvsch.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4zaidtnw6g74outanobj5g2i/bafkreia2brueyxlkikm6g3b3t4rrplscoycca2ajcwk5aygkfncmovg2ri"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-18T23:20:40.314Z",
			"content": "<p>That, but also I would probably just do one module that just exports the class, and give the snippet with the define call in documentation.</p>\n<p>Teach people to fish, etc.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4zaidtnw6g74outanobj5g2i/app.bsky.feed.post/3liiftjdcn22t",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4zaidtnw6g74outanobj5g2i/app.bsky.feed.post/3liifltzr3k2t",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/fvsch.com/post/3liiftjdcn22t",
			"author": {
				"name": "Florens Verschelde",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/fvsch.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4zaidtnw6g74outanobj5g2i/bafkreia2brueyxlkikm6g3b3t4rrplscoycca2ajcwk5aygkfncmovg2ri"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-18T23:24:57.532Z",
			"content": "<p>I don't know, I guess I've been burned by jQuery plugins and other frontend scripts that perform side effects on the page automatically and don't let you take control. So now I'd rather import the class and register myself. 🫠</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4zaidtnw6g74outanobj5g2i/app.bsky.feed.post/3liigbwajak2t",
