				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4zaidtnw6g74outanobj5g2i/bafkreia2brueyxlkikm6g3b3t4rrplscoycca2ajcwk5aygkfncmovg2ri"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-18T23:33:00.835Z",
			"content": "<p>If you really want to do a query parameter thing, I'd make the side effects opt-in.</p>\n<p>?define<br>\n?define=custom-name</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3liihpnm3o22h",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liibc7jbhc2v",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com/post/3liihpnm3o22h",
			"author": {
