			},
			"date": "2025-02-18T23:58:35.280Z",
			"content": "<p>Should probably also have an</p>\n<p>export * from \"./light-editor.js\"</p>\n<p>Just in case anything else gets exported 🤷‍♂️</p>\n<p>but yea it's the pattern I've hated the least. Although you are right in that it incurs an extra network request on CDNs just to call the registering function</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ec64xv7n5dszeizw56yr6b5h/app.bsky.feed.post/3liihuuguic23",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4zaidtnw6g74outanobj5g2i/app.bsky.feed.post/3liigbwajak2t",
